					"content": "阿卡狄亚…好像没听说过。对不起，我还是协会的新人，了解的情报比较少。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4610604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杰克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4610604,
					"content": "这样啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4610605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4610605,
					"content": "不如试着去协会里挂个委托看看？有实力的老手们也是很活跃的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4610606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杰克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4610606,
					"content": "不行不行不行，这可不行。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4610607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4610607,
					"content": "万一被那些冒险家们捷足先登，把宝藏拿走就完了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4610608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4610608,
					"content": "（就这么说出去了…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4610609
